Error [E0331]: group `Fire` can't carry a payload
  --> tests/ui/enum_group_payload.jet:2:9
    |
  2 |     Fire(Int) {
    |         ^^^^^
 Why: a variant group only names its subtree — data lives on the leaf variants (D-TAG1)
 Fix: move the payload onto the leaf variants inside the `{ }`, or remove the `(...)`
